WEBVTT

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.790
Within the Hidden Leaf Village 
is the famous Mount Hokage.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:38.360
The face of each Hokage has been
painstakingly carved into the cliff side.

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:43.740
And here is the Fifth Hokage, Tsunade!

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.120
Let's go, Shizune.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.040
Yes, Lady Tsunade.

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:53.380
<b>Dice House</b>

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:58.610
Hello, boys.

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:01.220
I came to play.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:11.230
<b>Even Hokages Go Bald</b>

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.230
Today we're training with ninja tools.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:17.040
Tools?

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:17.630
Nunchaku

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.090
Yup!

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.060
T-These are...

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.880
N-Nunchaku...

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.030
Re-rolling a scroll is such a pain.

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:29.540
Hey, Tenten.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:30.420
Huh?

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:32.190
Are you bad with nunchaku, Lee?

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:33.750
No...

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.750
I'm psyched!

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.970
Wow, you rock!

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:39.930
Duck!

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:45.300
Are you insane?!

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.730
You just turned the carving 
of Lady Tsunade bald!

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:48.770
I'm sorry!

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.160
Move it, Lee!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.730
We've gotta get it back to normal!

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:57.810
Can we get my face back to normal, too,

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.770
when we're finished?

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:03.350
<i>Tenten's a totally different person when
the subject turns to Lady Tsunade...</i>

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:09.930
So that's Tsunade,
the Fifth Hokage, huh?

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.180
We'll sniff her out, then snuff her out!

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.530
Who are they?!

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:16.710
We've gotta warn Lady Tsunade!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.630
<b>Big Time
Dice House</b>

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:21.190
I roll first.

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:22.200
Here goes!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.290
Three and four, that's seven!

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:32.170
One, two, three, four, 
five, six, seven.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:35.230
"Run the three-legged race with 
your kids at a sports meet.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:38.690
Lose a turn for using up too much chakra."

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.530
Shoot!

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:42.780
Now it's my roll.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:47.850
Double sixes!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:51.190
Ten, eleven, twelve.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.940
"Arranged marriage to 
an Arabian oil tycoon.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.340
As a present, receive as many 
oil fields as are shown on the dice."

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.260
Yes! I get twelve oil fields!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.840
What?!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:06.720
Lady Tsunade's known in gambling
circles as the "Legendary Sucker,"

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.550
but she's cleaning up today.

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:09.810
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:15.850
Mount Fuji, a hawk, and an eggplant?

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.840
<b>No
Cheating</b>

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.350
What the heck?!

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:19.620
Guy?!

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:32.290
Back Door

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.880
There are rogue ninjas targeting me?

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:26.630
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:29.710
Team Guy rushed here to protect you,

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.290
so we had to grab the only 
disguises we had handy.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:37.450
I understand you were 
in a rush, but those?

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.940
Mountains...

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:42.380
We heard you were in Tanzakugai,

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.680
so we put on costumes that 
would bring good luck.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.050
But why am I the eggplant?

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.940
Lady Tsunade, um... I got this for you.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:52.520
A good luck charm?

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.730
Much appreciated.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.680
You're worked up, too,
 aren't you, Tenten?

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.190
Of course.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:05.190
I've always admired  
Lady Tsunade's strength.

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:06.300
But...

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.380
<i>I did it, Master!</i>

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.900
<i>Well done, Sakura.</i>

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.490
Since I can't use medical ninjutsu,

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.230
I couldn't become her student,

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:25.780
and I don't feel like 
I've earned her respect.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.380
Today is my big chance!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.390
<i>Well done, Lee!</i>

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:36.060
I know exactly how you feel!

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.210
You do?

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:40.010
I'll give it my all on this mission, too!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:45.110
Lady Tsunade, we'll escort 
you back to the village.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.900
Hold it, you!

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.950
You think you're just gonna 
hit it big and leave?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.280
The party's not over.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.300
Bring it on.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.210
<b>Big Time
Dice House</b>

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.130
Time to play some cards!

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:05.130
It doesn't matter.
Lady Luck's on my side today!

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.790
Maybe this one?

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.970
Ah, the old maid!

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:18.880
Are you sure it's okay for 
us to play, too, Guy Sensei?

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:22.090
It's part of guarding Lady 
Tsunade, we've got no choice.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.670
But it's our first time in Tanzakugai.

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:27.440
We don't even know the rules.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.500
The rules for Old Maid are simple.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.320
Whoever has the old 
maid at the end loses.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.740
Byakugan!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.530
It's the one on the far right!

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:39.310
Not the literal old maid!

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:41.480
Actually, technically speaking,

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.510
Lady Tsunade's a spinster, too.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.970
I've been told that despite her youthful
looks, she's really in her fifties.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.810
Shut your big mouth!

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.870
Okay, sure, maybe she's faking her looks,

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:52.930
but these days fifty-three
is still plenty young!

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:56.850
Excuse me for being a fake!

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.870
I-I'm sorry Lady Tsunade!
 I didn't mean—

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.860
Well, if she's not a spinster, then...

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.320
She's not a wrestler either!

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.790
Is that Tsunade?

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.240
She's not bald, though.

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:19.380
They say Tsunade's a master 
of medial ninjutsu, you know.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.330
Let's see if it's true.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:21.960
How?

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:26.810
Leave it to me. I've got a plan.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:30.940
Excuse me!

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:33.990
Please, is there a doctor in the house?

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:36.010
Is someone sick?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.400
I guess it happens, even in anime.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.600
Fine, I—

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.140
Yes, I'm a doctor!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:41.860
Huh?

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:43.080
We're hosed.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:43.960
Nuts...

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:46.020
I'll just have to be more direct.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.530
Excuse me!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.530
Please, is there anyone 
who's bald in here?

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.240
That would be me!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.580
You are?

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.240
I really should apologize.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.530
Things moved so fast,

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.680
I didn't have time to 
get a real hawk outfit.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.590
This is actually supposed 
to be a vulture.

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:06.210
But who knew it would 
actually save the day?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.560
No good. That nutjob's ruining it!

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:10.310
No, we can't give up yet.

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:11.760
There's still one last option.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.930
They say the real Tsunade's 
bust measurement is over 100 centimeters!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.890
Excuse me!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:21.720
Is there anyone in here with a 
bust measurement over 100 centimeters?

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:22.890
Right here.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.600
It's actually over 120—

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.360
That's not your bust!

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.570
See? We're toast!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.530
I'm not done yet!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.220
Excuse me!

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:34.740
Is there anyone in here 
wearing a lot of makeup,

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.410
but is really something 
else on the inside?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.700
Ooh, that's gotta be me!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.470
Snow white makeup.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.520
What is wrong with you?!

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.370
Your stupid indirect blathering's 
just getting worse!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.650
O-Okay...

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:48.950
Fine...

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.390
Excuse me!

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:54.300
Is there anyone in here who's very violent,
 loves to gamble, has no luck with men,

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:59.060
is having trouble hiding all their new wrinkles and sagging skin,

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:03.730
and is over fifty-three and still single?!

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.890
Enough already!

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.150
Hold it, hold it, hold it!

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.940
Trying to win and run, huh?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.110
I don't think so!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.210
Watch out!

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:15.160
Don't worry.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.610
We got them all.

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:22.080
L-Lady Tsunade...

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.910
What's your problem?!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:24.940
No way...

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:28.290
All the kunai we deflected 
landed right on her head.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.000
Lady Tsunade, get outside!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.750
Take them out.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:35.040
Wait!

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:38.870
Leaf Rising Wind!

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.180
You're safe now!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.810
We kicked them all away!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.130
L-Lady Tsunade!

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:46.910
No way...

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:50.100
All the guys we kicked 
landed right on her head!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.480
You'd better not be 
doing this on purpose!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:55.550
Stinkin' punks!

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.030
You need to knock them away from her!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.180
Eight Trigrams Rotation!

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.790
She's gone bald!

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:08.890
B-But...

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:11.720
Now she looks just like the 
rock carving we messed up.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.290
Everything's fine!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.110
Oh, yeah.

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.910
No, it's not!

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.470
So she's Tsunade after all.

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:22.080
Now's our chance.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:22.720
Yeah.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.790
Lady Tsunade!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:27.890
Shoot!

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:30.960
W-Whoa!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:32.840
Her good luck charm shot at us!

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.590
Weapon summoning.

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:39.180
I put a special stamp on the charm I
gave her that can shoot out weapons.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:41.180
<i>I...</i>

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:43.740
<i>I have to protect Lady Tsunade!</i>

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.570
Ultra Divine Blade Storm!

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:50.270
Goodbye!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:57.800
Um, Lady Tsunade...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:03.040
I'm so sorry. We completely 
failed to protect you.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.350
Tenten.

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:07.450
<i>No matter how mad she is, 
I have to accept my punishment.</i>

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.520
You really came through for me.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:20.490
Thanks to you, we got rid 
of those rogue ninjas.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.240
Great work, Tenten.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:26.500
<i>Yes! Lady Tsunade's proud of me!</i>

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:29.360
And Guy, Lee, Neji...

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.600
You three did a lot, too.

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.800
Don't mention it!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.800
I think you all deserve 
a special reward!

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.760
Uh oh!

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:49.230
Thankfully, no one was 
seriously injured.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.350
Farewell, fragile youth...

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.610
A back-alley casino in Tanzakugai.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:05.530
And within, a persistent gambler.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.960
Red 25, right hand.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.870
Yellow 7, tongue.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:19.450
Wait, it's Twister?!

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:21.380
I'm finished!

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:27.050
You thought you could 
beat me at roulette?

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:29.560
I'm chakra-ing out.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:33.780
That's three million chakra 
and two chocolates.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.800
You really cleaned up, Lord Orochimaru.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:39.370
It must be the snakeskin wallet I 
bought off the shopping channel.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.210
They said it would bring good luck.

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:45.530
What are you going to do 
with all that chakra?

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.860
What do you think?

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:51.000
I'll use it all...

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:01.010
<b>Orochimaru is Persistent</b>

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.930
Another day of ninja tool training.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:06.240
Chain Sickle

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.730
Hey, where's Lee?

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:15.360
Lee's off to repair the damage he 
did to Lady Tsunade's rock carving.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.440
Is he gonna be okay on his own?

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:20.900
That's a pompadour!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.860
What was he thinking?!

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:24.860
Hey, Lee!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:28.390
Why does Lady Tsunade 
have a pompadour now?!

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.780
Sorry!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:34.030
I'm trying, but I'm not 
very good at this!

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:39.510
Sadako?!

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:42.210
Ringlets?

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.420
Back to bald...

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:49.910
Why? Why won't my fingers 
listen to my brain?!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.080
How clumsy can you be?!

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.310
Let me handle this.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:03.000
It'll be a lot easier if we
plant trees for her hair,

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.490
instead of carving the rock!

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.990
I never would've thought of that!

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.450
Now it's a topknot!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:14.160
She's right, we'll need to plant more.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.410
I kinda like it, though.

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:18.620
An afro's no better!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.060
Not a problem.

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:21.870
Just a little off the top!

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.510
Now it's just a buzz cut...

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.850
Just stop already!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.000
What's that?!

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:29.760
What?

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.230
The forest is so full of life.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:42.110
This isn't the time for bird watching!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.040
Exactly!

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.190
Lady Tsunade!

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:47.150
I can't trust any of you to fix this.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.150
I'll do it myself!

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:53.650
Who is that?

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:01.330
T-That's—

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.410
I can't think...

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:06.470
...of a good joke!

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.540
You don't need a joke!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.510
You should be falling over in terror!

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:16.020
I've summoned Manda with the 
chakra I won in Tanzakugai,

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:19.230
and now I'm going 
to wipe out the Leaf Village.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.370
What a persistent man.

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:26.820
I'll handle him!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.200
Count me in!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.900
Summoning Jutsu!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.780
The village is in danger.

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:43.200
This may end up being a grueling battle.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:46.680
I try to avoid pointless fighting 
as much as possible,

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.760
but if it's to protect the 
village, I've no choice!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:52.260
You're all in danger, please retreat—

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:54.960
Katsuyu!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:02.230
I guess the Boss was hungry.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:04.400
<b>They all saved Katsuyu later.</b>

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.400
Why did you even summon him?!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.620
It's up to me now.

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:10.020
Can you use summons even if 
you can't use ninjutsu, Lee?

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:11.360
Trust me!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.280
Summoning Jutsu!

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:17.360
Why me?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.160
What am I saying?! 
Of course you can't!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.580
Especially not against 
that giant serpent!

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.960
Well, this was the biggest 
costume I had...

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.460
But don't worry!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:30.760
Mr. Cameraman, zoom in until 
Tenten's out of shot, please!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:33.430
If we just use the right angle...

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:35.040
Camera tricks?!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.690
It's an optical illusion 
accomplished with perspective!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.470
That doesn't work with anime!

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:47.400
Lady Tsunade!

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:51.600
So...

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:55.990
Who's next?

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:57.820
<i>It's working!</i>

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.450
<i>Last week's failures seem 
like a bad dream now!</i>

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:04.980
<i>Lord Orochimaru is completely 
different this week.</i>

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:07.960
But does it make for a good episode?

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.920
Shouldn't it be funnier 
or more light-hearted?!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:17.160
Granny Tsunade, we gotta get out 
quick or we're in deep trouble!

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.740
Light!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:28.520
Oh, you two were swallowed, as well?

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:30.460
Guy?

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.880
What're you doing here?

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:35.490
I was training up on the mountain.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:39.710
<i>Today, I will sing without 
disturbing the candle's flame.</i>

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:42.220
What kind of training is that?

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:46.160
Instead of not disturbing the candle,

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.470
both it and myself were 
slurped up whole!

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:50.670
Seriously, what kind 
of training is that?!

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:54.800
What're we gonna do, Lee?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.600
Don't worry. I've got an idea.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:03.470
I'll feed him this super-spicy curry.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:04.520
And then...

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:10.150
Here goes!

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:20.910
What happened?

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:22.370
Byakugan!

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.260
So spicy!

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:27.250
But so good!

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.040
Guy Sensei's eating it.

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:35.680
This is no time for dinner!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.590
There's no need to fret.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:43.260
I secretly developed a technique in case
something like this ever happened,

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.580
and now it's time to test it.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:46.790
What do you mean, it?

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.350
Who're you talking to?!

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:49.640
What's the matter?

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.770
If you want to stop me, 
turn around and fight!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.860
Yeah, this is a little too 
much for this series.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.340
We should shift back toward comedy.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.530
Then again...

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.930
It's useless. We can't fight him!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.220
We were fighting?

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:05.670
I thought we were just running...

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:08.690
Hey, is there an extra 
face on the mountain?

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:09.500
Huh?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.460
One, two, three, four, five, six...

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:16.270
Number six is Guy Sensei!

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:19.900
Wait, maybe, just maybe...

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:23.330
It's the giant robot Guy Sensei 
built for emergencies like this!

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.640
The giant robot,

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.330
Might Guygatron!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.600
Might Guygatron?!

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:30.290
Fight on, Might Guygatron!

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:32.620
Yeah, take him down!

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:39.490
Hmph, just a giant doll.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:42.160
We'll control it with chakra threads!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.660
Focus, focus, focus!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.260
Ha!

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.580
Neji, take the right half.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:52.650
Tenten, get the left.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:53.570
What about you Lee?

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:54.790
I'll control the eyebrows!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:58.300
Why the eyebrows?!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.470
Is that piano wire?

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.320
Let's go, team!

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:02.010
Huh?

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.060
Super Attack!

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:06.590
Robo-Sexy Jutsu!

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:08.810
It's showtime!

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:15.610
Giant robots don't need to do that!

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:18.880
Tee-hee...

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:21.200
How dare you think I'd fall for that?!

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.160
Ouch...

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:25.740
Ow, ow, ow!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:31.370
You think yourself a match for me?

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:37.420
If the Robo-Sexy Jutsu didn't work,

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:39.740
then we've only got one option.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.440
Is that move really all we've got left?

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:44.620
Can we do it with a robot?

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.420
We've gotta try.

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.280
W-What?

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.330
How can you still stand?

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.540
Three!

00:20:58.380 --> 00:20:59.500
Two!

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:01.900
One!

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:05.910
You're finished!

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.830
Shimura Style,

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:09.200
Wow-Wing!

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:13.940
No, it is I who am finished!

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.830
It's better this way.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:18.590
Yes...

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:23.500
And so, the Leaf Village was saved.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:26.980
Justice prevails!

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.230
Everyone came out safe and sound,

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:41.330
and they lived happily ever after.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:44.020
No, no, and no!

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:24.630
Hey, who's voice is that 
you hear after our gags?

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:26.420
You don't know either, Tenten?

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:29.900
I'm the nice fellow 
narrating this fine show.

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:32.300
So please, get on with the preview.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:33.190
What's your name?

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:34.040
It doesn't matter, just—

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:36.140
What're your hobbies? 
Height? Blood type?

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:38.250
Say the titles for the 
next episode, you morons!

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:42.050
N-Next week is "Hinata is Neji's Cousin,"

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:44.770
<b>Hinata is Neji's Cousin
Hinata's Weak Point is Naruto</b>

00:23:42.050 --> 00:23:44.770
and "Hinata's Weak Point is Naruto."

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:46.730
Very good.

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.000
He's scary...
